  "_notes": {
    "scope": "A PAST REVISION, superseded 2025-10-01. Carries 7 schedules (tou-dr1, ev-tou-5, tou-dr, tou-dr2, tou-elec, dr-ses, dr). EV-TOU-2 and EV-TOU publish no dated Total Rates Table under those names, so they fall back to the current revision with a warning; the PCIA table and file-level fixed charges still apply to them.",
    "prices": "Delivery = UDC Total + WF-NBC; generation = EECC; both read straight off each schedule's table. DR-SES delivery net of NBC = 0.27830, matching the 8/20-9/18/25 bill; PCIA 2021 = -0.01364, matching that bill to the cent. TOU hour windows carried over from the current revision (the table prints prices by period name, not clock hours).",
    "fixed": "Minimum Bill $0.402/day for TOU-DR1/TOU-DR/TOU-DR2/DR/DR-SES; EV-TOU-5 and TOU-ELEC carry a $16/month basic service fee instead. No AB 205 Base Services Charge yet.",
    "carried_over": "seasons, day_types, baseline, and taxes_and_fees carried from the current revision unverified — the Total Rates Tables do not restate them.",
    "approximations": "EV-TOU-5/TOU-ELEC monthly basic service fee (6/1/25) modelled as a daily rate. Rank-mapping assumes on>off>super price order held between 2025 and 2026, which it does."
